WEBVTT

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:03.480
Shingetsu's true identity was Vector!

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:05.020
I was tricked by him,

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.650
and I brought everyone to this dangerous Sargasso!

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.820
Plus, the five V cards that were the proof of my friendship with Shingetsu

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:14.360
were a trap meant to corner me!

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:17.780
I've only got three cards left in my deck.

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.450
As it is now...

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.500
Why not show me the <i>best you can do</i>?!

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.710
None of you will be crossing this path <i>alive anyway</i>!

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:31.920
And everything, Yuma, is because I <i>lured you here</i>!

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.130
Damn you!

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:38.680
What are you hoping to accomplish when you can't even lay a hand on me?

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:42.140
You're going to get <i>revenge</i> for me, right Yuma-<i>kun</i>?

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:44.460
Shit!

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:48.050
I can't believe Shingetsu-<i>kun</i> was a Barian...

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.630
Yuma knew this entire time and kept it from us, or not?!

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:53.280
Why would he do something like that...?

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:56.290
At this rate, Yuma and Astral will...

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.780
<i>I... I...</i>

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:04.140
I set one card and end my turn!

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:09.810
Then you'll take the effect of Sargasso I promised you!

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:20.960
Is this what they call "<i>tattered mind and soul</i>"?!

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:23.080
I'll hurt you even <i>more</i>!

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:30.440
We learned the truth through this vile trap Vector set up,

00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:32.380
and he's completely toying with us.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.530
Yeah, it's my fault.

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:36.360
It's because I was careless.

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:42.280
I intended to use our Barian card as a our weapon without thinking of the risks involved.

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:44.830
Just say it already!

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:49.790
If I never talked with Shingetsu, none of this would have happened!

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:51.240
Yuma...

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:52.900
Yeah, for sure!

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:57.720
It certainly wasn't good to keep it a secret from your partner, Astral.

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:01.430
That bastard took advantage of his weakness...

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:02.810
Shit...

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:05.140
This has become a vulgar fight...

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:12.520
You're just a <i>traitor</i> who chose your friendship with me over your own partner!

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.320
That was because you said it would protect Astral!

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:19.630
Wow, making nice <i>excuses</i> there!

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:21.360
You bastard!

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.170
<i>No good. If this continues...</i>

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:25.340
<i>He'll be lured into Vector's pace completely.</i>

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:26.440
<i>What should I do...?</i>

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:29.760
<i>This is...</i>

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:32.230
<i>What is...</i>

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:34.550
<i>This uneasiness suddenly surfacing...?</i>

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:39.350
<i>It feels as if it's being generated by a fragment of darkness...</i>

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:44.750
<i>Just what is... What is...?</i>

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:47.720
What're you spacing out for?

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:51.970
My turn! Draw!

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:55.800
Now I activate a Magic Card, Glorious Numbers!

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:59.370
When I have no Monsters on the field,

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:02.160
this card Special Summons a Number from my Graveyard!

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:07.630
Come on back, Number 104! Masquerade Magician - Shining!

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.250
And then, with this card's effect, I

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:14.290
draw one card!

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:17.970
What a pity it is. After you just got Hope Ray V out...

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.220
...it all turned out to be a complete waste of time!

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:24.750
So he had it planned out to revive his Number...

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:28.080
If this keeps up, Hope Ray V will be destroyed!

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:30.930
Destroyed?!

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:36.820
Take down Hope Ray V, who can't attack, activate any effects, or even shield you?!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.940
As long as he remains there,

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:43.610
you guys'll continue taking 500 points 
of damage from Sargasso's effect!

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:45.950
You gotta enjoy it thoroughly!

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:47.150
This bastard!

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:51.650
I'll activate Shining's effect!

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:54.210
Once per turn, Shining can

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:58.650
send one card from my opponent's deck to the Graveyard!

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:01.940
But when I use this effect,

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:04.390
Shining can't attack.

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:05.770
Shit!

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:08.960
Now you've only got two cards left in your deck.

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:13.060
When you lose the Duel, you'll sink into Sargasso.

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:17.630
And that ain't all. I wonder what'll happen to those friends that came with you?

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:23.190
Does he mean that we'll be buried in Sargasso forever?!

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.080
I don't want that!

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.950
I better get back, or not!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:29.180
Yuma...

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:34.560
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:40.530
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:43.240
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:55.590
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:58.670
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:03.180
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:05.550
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:08.770
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:13.310
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:15.440
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:18.150
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.610
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:23.660
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:26.120
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:32.160
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:34.920
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:36.380
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:41.090
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:50.140
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:06.300
Those frustrated expressions are great!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:10.550
"Countdown to Defeat!
 The Terror of Deck Destruction"

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:11.510
Now your little group of worthless human
 friends'll decrease in number!

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:12.850
Did you say worthless?!

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:17.270
I set one card and end my turn!

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:18.730
Here goes, Ryouga!

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.610
I activate Glorious Halo's effect!

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:27.610
By removing one Overlay Unit,

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:30.570
this Monster can negate one of the opponent's Monster's effects,

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.490
and then halve their Attack Power!

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:44.300
Go, Glorious Halo! Attack Shark Drake!

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:46.460
Lightning Cluster!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:54.890
Shark!

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.390
Go, Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.310
Attack Galaxion!

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:03.190
Tachyon Spiral of Annihilation!

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:11.530
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:14.990
Shark?! Kaito?!

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:17.080
What a pitiful state you're in, I'd say!

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.410
Those idiots foolishly following Yuma around...

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:22.120
D-Damn you!

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:29.220
I activate the Trap Card, Shark Revenge Splash!

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:32.800
When Shark Drake is destroyed,

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:35.890
this card revives it with 1000 additional Attack Points!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.680
Revive, Shark Drake!

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:45.770
Then he damages the opponent by its total Attack Power!

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:52.070
Heck yeah!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:57.910
But now that you've called out an Xyz Monster,

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.160
you'll take Sargasso's effect!

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:04.920
Shark!

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.170
It's okay.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:10.210
Ryouga will tear through his flesh and crush his bones,

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.550
and he'll make a last second breakthrough his tactics.

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:13.130
Huh?

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:19.810
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.480
My turn! Draw!

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:30.740
I use Marine Biting Dragon - Shark Drake as Xyz Material for a Chaos Xyz Change!

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:36.120
Come out, Chaos Number 32!

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:41.250
The mightiest fangs awaken from an abyss of pitch darkness!

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.500
Marine Biting Dragon - Shark Drake Veiss!

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.380
Oh crap! He'll take Sargasso's effect again!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.050
But that's good.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:54.970
Huh?

00:08:55.680 --> 00:09:01.350
When Shark Drake Veiss is Summoned while you have 1000 or more Life Points, it'll be destroyed.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:06.230
Ryouga used the effect of Sargasso and lowered his own Life,

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:07.350
and brought it down to 900.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.860
He-He planned that far?

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:13.900
A Special Summon through depleting your very life. Splendid!

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:17.450
I always knew you were a man like this.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.240
You make me think of that guy.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.710
That savage way of speaking and your straightforward soul you can feel head-on.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:29.000
And you, despite appearing as such,

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.800
conduct an honorable and earnest Duel!

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:34.380
Save your sleep talk for your bed!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.180
My turn! Draw!

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:42.600
I activate the Magic Card, Triangle Evolve!

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:47.190
When I have one Level Five or higher Monster on my field,

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:49.770
I can treat them as three material for an Xyz Summon!

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:54.070
I use the Level Eight Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon three times...

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:55.320
and Overlay them!

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.740
An Xyz Summon?! Is it coming?!

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:03.790
I use this Monster three times to build the Overlay Network!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:05.330
Xyz Summon!

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.420
Great Galaxy of Reversal,

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:12.670
become a surging wave of light and show yourself!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:20.300
Descend, my very Soul!

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:23.850
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:41.450
He'll take Sragasso's effect again!

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.370
But thanks to the effect of Triangle Evolve,

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:47.960
it loses 1000 Attack Points.

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:50.670
Neo Galaxy...

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.210
The battlefield's been set up.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.720
Trap, activate! Neutrino Dowsing!

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:03.050
When an Xyz Monster is Special Summoned to my opponent's field,

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:07.470
I can detach the Overlay Units from a Galaxy-Eyes on my field,

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:12.350
then send my Rank-Up Magic, Barian's Force to the Graveyard...

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.150
in order to activate its effect!

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:17.740
Barian's Force Ranks-Up an Xyz Monster on my field,

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.110
and Special Summons a Chaos Xyz!

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.280
He's ranking up during my turn?!

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:27.750
I use the Level Eight Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon,

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.960
and rebuild the Overlay Network!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.420
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:39.470
Surge through the milky way,

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.010
and be reborn from the previous times!

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:44.640
The star of dragon crossing over all time!

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:54.440
Manifest before us, Chaos Number 107!

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:11.660
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:22.840
So that's his Chaos Number?

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:28.760
That last time, the match ended with both Galaxy-Eyes before I could see it.

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.770
So he's playing it now?

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:39.480
That's right! The time has come for our true match!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.290
Wh-What the, or not?

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:51.660
Look at this! The airship is...!

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:54.000
The airship is being sucked in!

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:56.420
What?! That maelstrom...

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:02.010
Wh-What the?!

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:06.220
The airship...

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:08.100
Oh, that?

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:10.220
It happens from time to time.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:14.690
Things get sucked up within the black holes that form in Sargasso!

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:16.440
What did you say?!

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:20.480
They then become sacrifices within this Sargasso!

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.320
Someone!

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.490
Stop this, or not!

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:26.240
G-Guys...

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:27.870
If this goes on...

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:32.870
The escape route...! We have to get away!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:35.540
Yuma...

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:36.710
Kotori!

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.630
Know where that hole leads?

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:45.470
If I temporarily alter the effect of Sargasso's Lighthouse,

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.430
I may be able to save those guys.

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:51.390
But not without a price.

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:52.260
What?!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:57.600
You gotta hand over all the Numbers you're holding.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.860
Hand you all the Numbers?!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.950
No way you could!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:16.160
'Coz your partner Astral will suffer greatly once you do!

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:19.210
Then you should give up on your friends in the airship.

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:22.710
Screw you! Your opponents are me and Astral!

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.880
Kotori and the others have nothing to do with this!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:29.930
But you're the one who brought those friends who have nothing to do with this here!

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:36.600
So what'll you do? Save Astral or help your friends?

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:38.560
You only get two out of one.

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:42.400
What should I do? If this keeps up, Kotori and the others will...

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.020
Calm down, Yuma.

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:46.360
The guys are in danger!

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:49.990
You sure are cold, Astral. They're his friends!

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:54.160
I can't just choose between Astral and Kotori and the others.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.040
I just can't choose!

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:58.160
Yuma, don't you get it?!

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:00.040
This is all Vector's plan!

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:01.460
Shut up!

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.420
I just want to save my precious friends!

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:06.840
I just want to save everyone!

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:12.550
Great! You look so pained! That frustrated expression is nice!

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:20.560
Why are you unsure of yourself, Yuma?!

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:25.150
Just continue the Duel with Astral!

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:27.480
What are you saying?

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.360
We'll be fine.

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:30.650
Kotori?

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:34.660
We didn't come here to hold you back, Yuma!

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.910
Your mission is to protect Astral!

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:39.500
That's what you need to do!

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:43.000
Win! You have to win this Duel!

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:47.630
If you believe in the bond between your friends you hold so dear,

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.590
and you're not mistaken about that,

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:53.470
prove that you're not wrong about it!

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:56.100
Kotori...

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:58.850
Bring it to 'im, Yuma!

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.610
Check the command system, Tokunosuke-<i>kun</i>!

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:06.860
Okay, or not!

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:08.730
Class Rep, you take the power system!

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:10.030
Roger!

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:12.820
Cat-<i>chan</i>, you monitor the system's status!

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:13.740
Okay!

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:15.320
Everyone, wait just a minute.

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:17.080
Orbital!

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:21.540
Under Kaito-<i>sama</i>'s order, Orbital 7 is here!

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:28.170
Access granted.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.880
Canceling security!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:31.590
Main engine activated!

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:38.100
Hard push to starboard, or not!

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:48.690
Kotori! Guys! You can do it!

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:50.530
Output at its max!

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.570
Moving from Block E to J!

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.950
Don't give up! We'll definitely make it through this!

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:02.960
Bring it to it, everyone!

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:24.350
We've escaped the critical point.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:27.770
They did it! Alright!

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:30.650
That was awesome, everyone!

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:33.240
Now it's your turn, Yuma!

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:34.530
To summarize...

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:36.410
You better win, or not!

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:37.780
Cat it to 'im!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:38.990
Guys...

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:43.370
I'm sorry. You were put in danger because of me.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:44.120
I...

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.160
You're wrong, Yuma.

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:49.590
I came here of my own will.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:52.000
We owe the Barians for what they did.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:55.340
Even if you tried to stop me, I'm here of my own free will.

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:57.590
Shark... Kaito...

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.930
If you've got the time to worry about worthless emotions,

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:03.060
just kick that guy's ass already!

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:05.930
Yeah! I'll take care of it!

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:09.560
Astral, I'm sorry for everything...

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.070
I'm really sorry!

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:13.400
Yuma...

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.610
Let's win this Duel!

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:17.650
Right!

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:19.870
Let's do ZEXAL!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.870
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:24.240
Me...

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:25.410
...and me!

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:27.000
We Overlay!

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:29.330
It's ZEXAL!

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.460
Here it comes!

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:36.550
It's time for the final finish, Astral!

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:41.430
Will you really become one with Yuma?

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:46.430
Do you really believe in Yuma from the bottom of your heart?

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:49.230
Aren't you doubting him deep down?

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:52.730
Because Yuma went and lied to you...

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:58.030
Take a good look at what you want deep within your heart...

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.320
Closely...

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:12.420
Astral?

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.840
Yuma, I...

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:20.840
Right, isn't there a tiny bit of darkness deep within your heart?

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:24.260
It's about time you accept it.

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:28.100
Accept the evil... Accept it...

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:31.850
You've been blaming Yuma for a long time now little by little...

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:35.400
Astral! Within your heart, that grudge you hold...

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:38.650
...that suspicion is aimed at the one who betrayed you!

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:42.200
It was meant to open your eyes to your anger!

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.200
Wh-What did you say?

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:48.580
You don't even know about the doubt you have in your heart.

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.040
And you don't even know that you've been affected by his betrayal.

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:56.880
That's why even the smallest of darkness is enough...

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.090
That alone is fatal to you.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:06.890
Because that tiny bit of darkness is pulling you into an endless pit of despair!

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:11.390
Screw you! Astral won't lose to something like that!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:21.030
I wonder. Can you pull Astral out
 of the darkness he's been swallowed by?

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:22.450
What?!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:27.080
Did you forget?! Hope Ray V is the power of Barian!

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:36.250
Astral!

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:49.770
Astral! Astral!

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:54.020
Accept the evil... The evil...

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:06.820
Astral...?

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:13.790
He's gone out of control!

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:20.170
ZEXAL... ZEXAL... ZEXAL... ZEXAL...

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:23.470
Astral! What's wrong with you?!

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:26.970
ZEXAL! ZEXAL! ZEXAL!

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:28.050
Stop it!

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:31.890
What?!

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:33.600
Yuma! Astral!

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:44.990
That's...!

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:24.190
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:31.870
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:39.460
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.460 --> 00:22:46.800
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.340 --> 00:23:03.730
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:08.530
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:18.870
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:18.870 --> 00:23:27.420
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:32.220
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:38.520
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:43.520
Now that Astral has been consumed by darkness, I...

00:23:43.810 --> 00:23:46.400
Within Astral, there's a giant Astral statue!

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:47.980
Just where are we?

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:51.360
Yuma, you betrayed me...

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:53.200
What's with that ZEXAL?

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:54.950
Dark Charge!

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:56.990
Let's go back together, Astral!

00:23:57.330 --> 00:23:59.660
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:02.710
"Break Through the Limit!!
 'Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray Victory'!

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:04.290
I won't give up.

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:07.880
You won't hurt what's important to me any longer!
